  "description": "⭐<em> Don’t miss the </em><strong><em>Peppa Pig Halloween London Sightseeing Bus Tour</em></strong><em> from Brigit’s Bakery, a spooky afternoon tea experience through London’s most famous landmarks. Enjoy Halloween treats, family sing-alongs, and a best-dressed costume prize on this limited-time adventure.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎃 Enjoy a spooky Peppa Pig Halloween afternoon tea with themed treats for kids and grown-ups<br>\r\n🚌 Discover iconic London sights including Big Ben and St Paul's Cathedral<br>\r\n🎶 Sing along to Peppa Pig songs with an interactive tablet animation at every table<br>\r\n🏆 Dress up in Halloween costumes for a chance to win the best-dressed family prize<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Dietary Requirements</strong><br>\r\n<strong>🚩After booking, you’ll be asked to select your menu and share any dietary requirements. Please double-check your choices, as they cannot be changed once submitted.🚩</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>🎉 Looking for even more Peppa Pig fun in London? Don’t miss these special bus tours packed with themed treats, entertainment, and unforgettable moments for the whole family:</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n🐷 <strong>Peppa Pig Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Bus Tour</strong> – Hop aboard for a delightful ride through London while enjoying a delicious themed afternoon tea, interactive entertainment, and plenty of Peppa Pig fun along the way. Book your tickets <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/599704?thm=12311\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a><br>\r\n🎄 <strong>Peppa Pig Christmas Sightseeing Bus Tour</strong> – Experience London’s magical Christmas lights with seasonal treats, joyful entertainment, and plenty of holiday cheer. Book your tickets <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/599365?thm=12311\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour and 30 minutes<br>\r\n<strong>📍 Departure: </strong><strong>Temple (Bus Stop N), Victoria Embankment, by Temple Tube Station</strong><br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 2+<br>\r\n❗<strong>&nbsp;Any allergies must be emailed and confirmed by management at bus@b-bakery.com&nbsp;</strong>❗<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: please refer to the <a href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/plan/faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs</a><br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/bus-tours/peppa-pig-halloween\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nCelebrate Halloween with Peppa Pig on a magical London sightseeing bus tour filled with spooky afternoon tea treats. Enjoy family sing-alongs, a Peppa Pig-guided animation on in-table tablets, and spectacular views of famous landmarks such as Big Ben and Tower Bridge. Costumes are encouraged, with a prize for the best-dressed family, making this limited-time adventure a fun-filled day for kids and grown-ups alike. Get your tickets for <em>Peppa Pig Halloween London Sightseeing Bus Tour</em> in London!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n©&nbsp;2026&nbsp;ABD&nbsp;Ltd/ Hasbro/HCPL&nbsp;Ltd.",
